<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ad Sarah Fortuito — Civil Engineer & Builder</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,500;9..144,700;9..144,900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>

  :root{
    --bg: #14120D;
    --panel: #1D1A13;
    --panel-2: #23261F;
    --line: #3B3627;
    --ink: #F4EFE4;
    --ink-soft: #A79E8B;
    --gold: #C9A227;
    --gold-soft: #8A7530;
    --sage: #5C6B52;

    --serif: 'Fraunces', serif;
    --sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body{
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  a{ color: inherit; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible{
    outline: 2px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .wrap{ max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.75rem; }
  section{ padding: 6rem 0; }
  hr.rule{ border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .eyebrow{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .eyebrow .num{ color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .eyebrow::after{ content:''; flex:1; height:1px; background: var(--line); }

  h2.head{
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem);
    max-width: 26ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }
  h2.head em{ font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }

  /* NAV */
  header.top{
    position: sticky; top:0; z-index: 30;
    background: rgba(20,18,13,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav{ display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items:center; padding: 1.2rem 0; }
  .name{ font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
  .nav-links{ display:flex; gap: 2.1rem; list-style:none; }
  .nav-links a{ text-decoration:none; font-size: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .nav-links a:hover{ border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 5rem 0 4.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-plan{
    position: absolute;
    right: -60px; top: -40px;
    width: 480px; height: 480px;
    opacity: 0.16;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero .kicker{
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; display:block;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.4vw, 4.1rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }
  .hero h1 em{ font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; color: var(--gold); }
  .hero p{ color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 42ch; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 2.1rem; }
  .cta-row{ display:flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration:none; border: 1px solid var(--line); cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn.solid{ background: var(--gold); color: #14120D; border-color: var(--gold); }
  .btn.solid:hover{ background: #b28f22; }
  .btn.ghost{ color: var(--ink); background: transparent; }
  .btn.ghost:hover{ border-color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .photo-frame{
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 0.6rem;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .photo-frame img{ display:block; width:100%; height:auto; filter: grayscale(0.1) contrast(1.03) sepia(0.06); }
  .photo-frame .tag{
    position:absolute; bottom: 1rem; left: 1rem;
    background: rgba(20,18,13,0.85);
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--gold);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem; border: 1px solid var(--gold-soft);
  }

  /* ICON STRIP */
  .strip{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap: 2.2rem;
    padding: 1.8rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .strip-item{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .strip-item svg{ flex-shrink:0; width:18px; height:18px; stroke: var(--gold); }

  /* FEATURED PROJECT */
  .case{
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .case-top{ display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  .case h3{ font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.7rem; }
  .status{
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--sage);
    border: 1px solid var(--sage); padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .case p.lede{ color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 62ch; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }

  .highlights{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }
  .highlight{ display:flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items:flex-start; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .highlight svg{ flex-shrink:0; width:18px; height:18px; stroke: var(--gold); margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  .highlight strong{ color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; display:block; }

  .case-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .case-grid dt{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .case-grid dd{ color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .tags{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .tag{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--ink-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; }

  @media (max-width: 780px){ .case-grid, .highlights{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* SAMPLE PROJECT */
  .thesis-render{ border: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .thesis-render img{ display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
  .thesis-meta{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .thesis-meta .label{ display:block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  @media (max-width: 780px){ .thesis-meta{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

  .plan-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .plan-tile{ border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .plan-tile img{ display:block; width:100%; height: 220px; object-fit: contain; object-position: center; background: var(--panel-2); padding: 0.4rem; }
  .plan-label{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .plan-tile.empty{ height: 190px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .plan-placeholder{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--ink-soft); text-align:center; line-height: 1.6; }
  .plan-placeholder span{ color: var(--gold-soft); }
  @media (max-width: 860px){ .plan-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px){ .plan-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .studio-gallery{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .studio-tile{ border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .studio-tile img{ display:block; width:100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; }
  .studio-tile .cap{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  @media (max-width: 860px){ .studio-gallery{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px){ .studio-gallery{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .video-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .video-tile{ border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel-2); }
  .video-tile video{ display:block; width:100%; height: 260px; object-fit: contain; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .video-tile .cap{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); }

  /* PROCESS */
  .process{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0; }
  .p-step{ position: relative; padding: 0 1.4rem 0 0; }
  .p-step .p-num{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--gold-soft); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .p-step h4{ font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .p-step p{ color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .p-step:not(:last-child)::after{
    content: '→'; position:absolute; right: -0.3rem; top: 0; color: var(--line); font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .process{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .p-step:nth-child(2)::after{ content:''; }
    .p-step::after{ display:none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px){ .process{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* SKILLS - magazine grid */
  .skill-cols{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .skill-col{ border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.75rem; }
  .skill-col .col-label{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .skill-col ul{ list-style:none; }
  .skill-col li{ padding: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.94rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .skill-col li strong{ color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
  @media (max-width: 780px){ .skill-cols{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* PORTFOLIO GRID */
  .grid-2{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  .grid-tile{ border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .grid-tile .swatch{
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    background: var(--panel-2);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-soft);
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 9px, rgba(201,162,39,0.06) 9px, rgba(201,162,39,0.06) 10px);
    text-align: center; padding: 1rem;
  }
  .grid-tile .meta{ padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.4rem; }
  .grid-tile h4{ font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .grid-tile .sub{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gold); }
  @media (max-width: 700px){ .grid-2{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* TIMELINE */
  .timeline{ border-left: 1px solid var(--line); padding-left: 1.9rem; }
  .t-item{ margin-bottom: 2.1rem; position: relative; }
  .t-item:last-child{ margin-bottom: 0; }
  .t-item::before{ content:''; position:absolute; left:-2.06rem; top: 0.4rem; width: 8px; height:8px; background: var(--gold); }
  .t-item .role{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .t-item .org{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .t-item p{ color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.92rem; max-width: 60ch; }

  /* EDUCATION */
  .edu-row{ display:flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.15rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .edu-row:last-child{ border-bottom: none; }
  .edu-row .school{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .edu-row .detail{ color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  /* WHY / CONTACT */
  .why-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0.9rem 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .why-item{ display:flex; gap: 0.7rem; align-items:flex-start; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .why-item svg{ flex-shrink:0; width:16px; height:16px; stroke: var(--gold); margin-top:0.2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px){ .why-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .contact-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  .contact-info p{ color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.98rem; }
  .contact-info .label{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gold); }
  .field{ margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
  .field label{ display:block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .field input, .field textarea{
    width:100%; background: transparent; border:none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.1rem; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field textarea:focus{ border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }
  @media (max-width: 720px){ .contact-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  footer{ border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 2rem 0; }
  footer .wrap{ display:flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.85rem; }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <div class="name">Ad Sarah Fortuito</div>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#thesis">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="#studio">Studio</a></li>
        <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
        <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
        <li><a href="#showcase">Video Editing</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ugc">Content Photo</a></li>
        <li><a href="#background">Background</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <svg class="hero-plan" viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <g fill="none" stroke="#C9A227" stroke-width="1.3">
          <rect x="30" y="30" width="340" height="300"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="150" x2="220" y2="150"/>
          <line x1="220" y1="30" x2="220" y2="330"/>
          <line x1="220" y1="230" x2="370" y2="230"/>
          <circle cx="290" cy="90" r="26"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="360" x2="370" y2="360"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="352" x2="30" y2="368"/>
          <line x1="370" y1="352" x2="370" y2="368"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Civil Engineer · Full-Stack Builder · Content Creator · Tutor</span>
        <h1>Engineer by training. <em>Adaptable</em> by design.</h1>
        <p>Structural drawings, full-stack code, video edits, social media campaigns, and math tutoring — four fields, one person who picks up new work fast and delivers in all of them.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="#work" class="btn solid">View the project</a>
          <a href="mailto:adsarahf@gmail.com" class="btn ghost">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-frame">
        <img src="2x2.jpg" alt="Portrait of Ad Sarah Fortuito">
        <span class="tag">CE · SUSC</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="strip">
      <div class="strip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg>Civil engineering</div>
      <div class="strip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 20V10M12 20V4M20 20v-7"/></svg>Full-stack development</div>
      <div class="strip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 7h13v10H3z"/><path d="M16 10l5-3v10l-5-3"/></svg>Video editing</div>
      <div class="strip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5"/><path d="M8.2 10.9l7.6-3.8M8.2 13.1l7.6 3.8"/></svg>Social media management</div>
      <div class="strip-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V5H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 7.5v12z"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 11h8"/></svg>Math tutoring</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SAMPLE PROJECT -->
  <div class="wrap">
    <section id="thesis">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="num">01</span><span>Sample Project</span></div>
      <h2 class="head">A three-storey building, documented from render to <em>working drawings</em>.</h2>

      <div class="thesis-render">
        <img src="render.jpg" alt="Exterior render of a three-storey residential and commercial building with a landscaped courtyard and palm trees">
      </div>

      <div class="thesis-meta">
        <div><span class="label">Project</span>Three-Storey Residential/Commercial Building</div>
        <div><span class="label">Client</span>Mrs. Cristina R. Fajardo</div>
        <div><span class="label">Team</span>Rojas, Fortuito, Deguit, Balbon — JYCA Construction</div>
        <div><span class="label">Date</span>November 2024</div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan-grid">
        <div class="plan-tile">
          <img src="floorplan.jpg" alt="Architectural drawing sheet showing first floor, second and third floor, and roof deck plans with dimensions">
          <div class="plan-label">Architectural — Floor Plans</div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-tile">
          <img src="structural.jpg" alt="Structural framing plan sheet showing foundation plan and second and third floor framing plan with column and beam labels">
          <div class="plan-label">Structural — Framing Plan (S-01)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-tile">
          <img src="plumbing.jpg" alt="Plumbing water line layout sheet showing first floor and second and third floor water line plans with plumbing symbol legend">
          <div class="plan-label">Plumbing — Water Line Layout (P-01)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-tile">
          <img src="electrical.jpg" alt="Electrical lighting layout sheet showing first floor and second and third floor lighting plans with electrical symbol legend">
          <div class="plan-label">Electrical — Lighting Layout (EL-01)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule">

  <!-- MINI STUDIO -->
  <div class="wrap">
    <section id="studio">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="num">02</span><span>Interior Design</span></div>
      <h2 class="head">A mini studio for rent — designed room by room, for photo and video shoots.</h2>

      <p style="color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 62ch; margin-bottom: 2rem;">A rentable content studio concept: a changing area for clients to get camera-ready, a lounge to wait and brief between setups, and a clean cyclorama wall for shooting. Visualized end to end in D5 and Lumion — the same rendering skillset behind the building above, aimed at a different kind of client.</p>

      <div class="thesis-meta" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div><span class="label">Type</span>Rental studio — interior design concept</div>
        <div><span class="label">Tools</span>D5 Render, Lumion</div>
        <div><span class="label">Rooms</span>3 — changing, lounge, cyclorama</div>
      </div>

      <div class="studio-gallery">
        <div class="studio-tile">
          <img src="makeup_station-changing_room.jpg" alt="Makeup station and changing room with a lit vanity mirror, director's chair, curtained changing area, and a black shelving unit styled with books and a coffee station">
          <div class="cap">Makeup station &amp; changing room</div>
        </div>
        <div class="studio-tile">
          <img src="lounge_area.jpg" alt="Lounge and waiting area with a grey sofa, curved accent chairs, an organic-shaped coffee table, and a view into the white cyclorama beyond">
          <div class="cap">Lounge &amp; waiting area</div>
        </div>
        <div class="studio-tile">
          <img src="cyclorama.jpg" alt="Empty white cyclorama photo and video backdrop wall with studio lighting stands and an overhead lighting grid">
          <div class="cap">Cyclorama backdrop</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule">

  <!-- PROCESS -->
  <div class="wrap">
    <section id="process">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="num">03</span><span>How I Work</span></div>
      <h2 class="head">One process, whether it's a building or a build.</h2>

      <div class="process">
        <div class="p-step"><div class="p-num">01</div><h4>Discover</h4><p>Understand the real workflow and who it's actually failing.</p></div>
